<title>USA: NPC acquires 31 Pizza Huts.</title>
<headline>NPC acquires 31 Pizza Huts.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURG, Kan. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>NPC International Inc said on Wednesday it had signed a letter of intent with R&amp;W Pizza Huts of North Carolina Inc to acquire 31 Pizza Hut restaurants and associated territories located in North Carolina.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The 28 restaurants and 3 delivery carry-out units generate average annual volumes in excess of $780,000 per storem NPC said.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to close the transaction by mid-November.</p>
</text>
